<section class="panel"><h2>SOW and capacity context</h2><p><span class="badge badge-warning">{{ report.sow_capacity.interpretation|replace('_',' ')|upper }}</span></p><table><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th class="numeric">Commitment</th><th class="numeric">Actual</th><th class="numeric">% of contract</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for metric in report.sow_capacity.metrics %}<tr><td>{{ metric.name or metric.label or 'Metric' }}</td><td class="numeric">{{ metric.target or metric.sow_target or '—' }}</td><td class="numeric">{{ metric.actual if metric.actual is not none else 'Not supplied' }}</td><td class="numeric">{{ metric.pct_of_contract or metric.achievement_pct or '—' }}</td><td>{{ metric.status or 'Not assessed' }}</td></tr>{% else %}<tr><td colspan="5" class="muted">No SOW capacity metrics were loaded.</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table><p class="footnote">Testing-coverage risk means observed volume is not representative of contracted scale. Commercial review means the SOW consumption needs an ownership decision.</p></section>
